// THE MEMBER ROUTE'S OWN IMPORTS: the claim drives the walk's decision body with a SUPPLIED member over the
// environment the PRODUCTION route builds (module_acquisition's acquisition_env), so it names the real
// constructors and no stub. DESIGN section 3: the claim supplies values at the boundary it answers for, never
// the result of running the producer.
import std.content_hash { content_hash_atom }
